      "title": "This week vs target",
      "description": "Training load (TRIMP) of the current week, Monday to today, against the grey band of the chart.\n- **Target**: at this load, your fitness stays the same.\n- **Upper limit**: above this load, the load increases faster than you can usually sustain.\n\n**This week** is grey below the target, green from the target to the upper limit, and orange above the upper limit. It is grey during the week until you reach the target.",
